## Misfits flags
ent-MisfitsFlagWallBrotherhoodBonneville509 = Flag of the 509th Brotherhood of Steel
    .desc = The banner of the 509th Brotherhood of Steel, an offshoot of the Mojave Chapter that survived Operation Sunburst and spent a decade as ghosts of the salt flats. Now risen as an active vanguard, they secure the region's lost technology before the Enclave or the ignorant can seize it.
ent-MisfitsDecorationFlagTribe = Banner of the Willowers Tribe
    .desc = The banner of the Willowers Tribe, a local settlement who worship the 'tree of life' illustrated on this flag. When the bombs first dropped, Wendover split into three survivor communities, the Locusts, Vultures and Willowers. The Willowers harvests and hunts were responsible for keeping all three fed in the first few years.
ent-MisfitsDecorationFlagBoSBonneville509 = Flag of the 509th Brotherhood of Steel
    .desc = The banner of the 509th Brotherhood of Steel, an offshoot of the Mojave Chapter that survived Operation Sunburst and spent a decade as ghosts of the salt flats. Now risen as an active vanguard, they secure the region's lost technology before the Enclave or the ignorant can seize it.

